# Copy to .env.local (gitignored via *.local) for local development.
#
# This file is the console's ENTIRE configuration, and it is dev-only. There is deliberately no
# client id, no API base URL and no issuer here:
#
#   * The OIDC client id, redirect URI and issuer live in the Lambda (NeotmsConfig -> environment),
#     because the backend runs the whole PKCE flow. A copy in the bundle could drift from the
#     server's, and the symptom of that is an opaque `invalid_request` from the account system.
#   * The API base is empty by design - the console and the API are served from one CloudFront
#     distribution, so every call is a relative path. That also means moving to a custom domain
#     needs no rebuild.
#
# The practical consequence: a build made on a laptop cannot be pointed at the wrong backend,
# because it carries no backend address at all.

# Where `npm run dev` proxies /api/* to. Use the ConsoleUrl output of `npm run deploy`.
# Not exposed to client code - deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_.
NEOTMS_DEV_API_TARGET=https://dxxxxxxxxxxxxx.cloudfront.net
